Source provenance
=================

src/fyst_toast/sim_fyst.py is adapted from TOAST's SimGround operator.
The TOAST BSD-2-Clause license and author list are retained in LICENSE
and AUTHORS. UPSTREAM.json records the source commit and file hash.

scripts/save_trajectory_h5.py is adapted from the local working-tree example
fyst-trajectories/examples/fyst_to_toast/hdf5/03_save_trajectory.py.
That example was untracked in the source repository when copied; it is not
represented as a published upstream contribution. UPSTREAM.json records
the exact source file hash. The source repository's BSD-3-Clause license
is retained in LICENSES/fyst-trajectories-BSD-3-Clause.txt; this does not
attribute authorship of the local example to the upstream authors.

docs/patches/fyst-timeline-utc.patch archives the existing local changes to
FYST's src/fyst_trajectories/overhead/io.py, against the base commit recorded
in UPSTREAM.json. It is provided for reproducibility and is not applied
automatically. The source repository's BSD-3-Clause license is retained above.

The writer uses the installed FYST and TOAST implementations. These projects
remain separate dependencies; they are not vendored into this repository.
